  "title": "Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha",
  "justification": "AniDB episode 9 \"Kessen wa Umi no Ue de na no\" (The Decisive Battle Is to Be Over the Sea, 2004-10-27) is TVDB season 1 episode 9 \"The Decisive Battle Above the Ocean!\", where the default places it; the row sending it to season 3 episode 21 \"The Decisive Battle\" (2007), a StrikerS episode, is removed. AniDB specials S1-S8 (DVD press conference, pilot film, actor interviews and the Lyrical Party event) have no TVDB episode; S6-S8 fell by default on season 0 episodes 6-8, the Triangle Heart OVA (AniDB 958), so all eight are unmapped. S9 \"Picture Drama: Mahou Shoujo Lyrical IF\" (2014-10-01) is season 0 episode 20 \"Magical Girl Lyrical IF\" (2014-10-01).",
